# The SR10.4 install with the WHOLE SAU set, as it was actually driven on
# 2026-09-10, end to end. Produces `media/dn3500-sr10.4-aa-kept.awd`.
#
# This is `install-domainos.cmds` with the two things that file leaves open
# filled in from a running machine: the CALENDAR preamble it assumes but does
# not perform, and MINST's SAU selection, where the run that produced
# `dn3500-sr10.4-installed.awd` took the DN3500's `sau7` alone.
#
# Replayable with:
#
#   cp media/dn3500-invol-done.awd media/sau14.awd
#   python3 tools/mame-oracle/mdsession.py --stage prompt \
#       --disk media/sau14.awd \
#       --ctape media/domainos/019593-001.CRTG_STD_SFW_BOOT_1-REV.A.ct \
#       --rundir tools/mame-oracle/out/sau14 --keep-rundir \
#       --commands-timeout 0 --commands tools/mame-oracle/install-sau14.cmds \
#       --log sau14.log
#
# **The SAU selection is a template number, not a list.** MINST asks for a
# configuration template and `11` is the whole SAU set; the AA it leaves behind
# then holds `sau7 sau8 sau9 sau11 sau12 sau14` and the volume root holds
# `/sau14` with `domain_os` and `self_test` in it.
#
# **The calendar aborts and the set still takes.** `y` at the confirmation ends
# with `10200E6: 6100` on the console; the RTC has been written by then, which
# is what gets past "The calendar is more than a minute slow."
#
# **Swap cartridges only at a prompt, with the drive idle** -- C56, and it cost
# a run here: a swap queued behind a bare `!wait 8` raced the drive into
# `?(rbak) (open_input_volume) Unable to open backup file. - controller
# timeout`. Recovered by swapping back to 019594-001 and answering `yes` to the
# retry, which is why the tail of this file re-walks the four cartridges.
#
# **The ending is `!raw \x04` then `shut`, never `!exit`** -- `sr10-3-install-route`,
# and `!exit` leaves a volume with its objects and not its links.

di c
!expect \n\n>
ex calendar
!expect enter none
w
!expect reset it
n
!wait 20
n
!wait 15
2002/11/28
!wait 15
12:00
!wait 20
y
!wait 25
di c
!expect \n\n>
ex domain_os
!expect \(Y/N\)
Y
!wait 30
sh
!expect login:
user
!expect Password:
!cr
!expect \$
/install/tools/minst
!wait 40
!cr
!wait 20
continue
!expect MINST>
novice
!wait 25
!cr
!wait 20
!cr
!wait 20
!cr
!wait 20
yes
!wait 25
ct
!expect key when ready:
!wait 8
!swap ctape media/domainos/019594-001.CRTG_STD_SFW_1.ct
!cr
!wait 40
!cr
!wait 30
11
yes
!wait 8
!swap ctape media/domainos/019594-002.CRTG_STD_SFW_2.ct
!cr
!wait 8
!swap ctape media/domainos/019594-003.CRTG_STD_SFW_3.ct
!cr
!wait 8
!swap ctape media/domainos/019594-004.CRTG_STD_SFW_4.ct
!cr
!cr
!wait 60
!swap ctape media/domainos/019594-001.CRTG_STD_SFW_1.ct
!wait 5
yes
!wait 90
!wait 6
!swap ctape media/domainos/019594-002.CRTG_STD_SFW_2.ct
!wait 4
!cr
!wait 60
!wait 6
!swap ctape media/domainos/019594-003.CRTG_STD_SFW_3.ct
!wait 4
!cr
!wait 60
!wait 6
!swap ctape media/domainos/019594-004.CRTG_STD_SFW_4.ct
!wait 4
!cr
!wait 60
!cr
!wait 30
select
!wait 40
ld /install/ri.apollo.os.v.10.4
!wait 20
!raw \x04
!wait 20
shut
!expect Shutdown successful
!wait 30
!exit
